  "releaseNotes": "- New ReflectionHelper.EntryAssemblyName property resolves the name of the entry assembly.\n- New ReflectionHelper.CallingAssemblyName property resolves the name of the entry assembly.\n- New ReflectionHelper.IsExecutedDefault property shows if the calling and the executing assemblies are equal.\n- Added extension method AsReadOnly<T>() to convert enumerables easier.\n- Using ValueTask<> instead of ValueTask<> as result type.\n- EnvironmentHelper was moved in from devdeer.Libraries.AspNetCore.RestApi.\n- DateTimeExtension.ToOffset() added.\n- DateTimeOffsetExtensions.ToUtcOffsetString() added.\n- Complete rework of ConversionHelper.GetSpeakingTimeString.\n- New CultureHelper allows executing in culture context.\n- Package updates.\n- Updated README",
